<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka issues first two year treasury bonds.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka issues first two year treasury bonds.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's Central Bank gave following details of the first ever issue of 500 million rupees two-year treasury bonds with a coupon rate of 14 percent per year on Thursday:</p>
<p>    Amount offered:	500 milion rupees</p>
<p>    Bids received:     1,139 million rupees</p>
<p>    Amount accepted:     500 million rupees</p>
<p>    Coupon rate:	   14 percent per year</p>
<p>Weighted Avg yield:  14 percent per year</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (94-1) 431187</p>
</text>
